---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Salary_Calc from '../../components/Salary_Calc.astro';
---
<Layout 
  title="Salary to Hourly Calculator | Convert Yearly to Hourly Pay" 
  description="Convert your annual salary into an hourly wage, weekly pay, and monthly pay instantly."
>
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Salary to Hourly Calculator</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Find out exactly how much your time is worth.</p>

    <Salary_Calc />

    <article class="article-content">
      <h2>How to Convert Salary to Hourly</h2>
      <p>To find your hourly rate, take your total annual salary and divide it by the total number of hours you work in a year. A standard full-time work year is 2,080 hours (40 hours a week multiplied by 52 weeks).</p>

      <h2>Why this matters for Freelancers</h2>
      <p>If you are transitioning from a full-time job to freelancing or consulting, you need to use this calculator. Freelancers have to cover their own taxes, health insurance, and business expenses. Many experts recommend charging an hourly rate that is at least 30% higher than your old corporate hourly rate to maintain the same standard of living.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; }
  h1 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .article-content { margin-top: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .article-content h2 { margin-top: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
